5144a46e5.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":3168,"title":"","description":"3","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Action","Adventure","Sci-Fi"],"id":3168,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Independence Day","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/shows/87f9e8a2-e90f-45ab-b5fb-8faa92befada.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk56/shows/e6ced445-5502-48c1-9162-9f1ba4759599.jpg","likes":86,"dislikes":3,"views":11255,"release_date":"836352000000","length":9213,"description":"On July 2nd, communications systems worldwide are sent into chaos by a strange atmospheric interference. It is soon learned by the military that a number of enormous objects are on a collision course with Earth. At first thought to be meteors, they are later revealed to be gigantic spacecraft, piloted by a mysterious alien species. After attempts to communicate with the aliens go nowhere, David Levinson, an ex-scientist turned cable technician, discovers that the aliens are going to attack major points around the globe in less than a day. On July 3rd, the aliens all but obliterate New York, Los Angeles and Washington, as well as Paris, London, Houston and Moscow. The survivors set out in convoys towards Area 51, a strange government testing ground where it is rumored the military has a captured alien spacecraft of their own. The survivors devise a plan to fight back against the enslaving aliens, and July 4th becomes the day humanity will fight for its freedom. July 4th is their Independence Day...","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7}],"value":7,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":3168,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}